={
  "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001",
  "max_tokens": 3500,
  "messages": [{
    "role": "user",
    "content": "You are generating 10 ready-to-produce content idea cards for a chiropractic content creator. Today is the start of a new content week.

TOP-DECILE PERFORMERS (last 30 days):
{{ JSON.stringify($node['Fetch Top Decile Performers'].json.topDecile) }}

RECENT INTEL (viral-insights + creator-insights + audience-demand, last 14 days):
{{ JSON.stringify($node['Fetch Recent Intel'].json.files) }}

CURRENT RANKED IDEAS (top 25 from the ranker — avoid duplicating these):
{{ JSON.stringify($node['Fetch Current Ranked Ideas'].json.ideas.map(i => ({ title: i.title, audienceTags: i.audienceTags }))) }}

Produce EXACTLY 10 idea cards in this JSON schema:
{
  "items": [
    {
      "content": "<headline (≤6 words) plus 1-2 line hook draft, max 3 lines total>",
      "audienceTags": ["prenatal" | "infant" | "kids" | "athlete" | "adult" | "senior" | "general"],
      "source": "weekly_studio",
      "sourceUrl": "<reference: which top-decile video or intel file this idea draws from>",
      "metadata": {
        "formatHint": "A" | "B" | "C" | "D" | "E" | "F" | "G",
        "hookPattern": "<myth_opener | stat_anchor | listicle | regret_frame | quick_win | contrarian>",
        "rationale": "<one sentence: why this idea now for this audience>"
      }
    }
  ]
}

Rules:
- Each card targets ONE audience segment
- Mix audiences across the 10 (don't make all 10 for prenatal)
- Lean into formats and audiences that appeared in the top-decile performers
- Don't duplicate the current ranked ideas
- Output JSON only, no preamble, no code fence"
  }]
}

parameters.jsCode:
// Parse Haiku's JSON output and shape it for bulk-seed.
const raw = $input.first().json.content?.[0]?.text ?? '';
const match = raw.match(/\{[\s\S]*\}/);
if (!match) throw new Error('Haiku returned no JSON object');
const parsed = JSON.parse(match[0]);
const items = (parsed.items || []).slice(0, 10);
return [{ json: {
  secret: $env.INBOX_BULK_SECRET,
  items
} }];

